{
  "id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
  "name": "OpsPilot — AI Operations Workflow",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## OpsPilot\n\nWebhook, then FastAPI, then one model call.\n\nThe workflow loads the supplier and the policy. Draft Proposal sends them to the model in one call. The model has no tools and must answer with the schema served by GET /prompts/system.\n\nIt cannot complete a request. The Wait node is the human gate.\n\nAfter import: attach your LLM credential to OpenAI Chat Model, the requester Header Auth credential to Webhook, and the approver Header Auth credential to Wait for Human Approval. Then activate the workflow.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "b6c1a001-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "How this workflow works",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "opspilot",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
